<Base title="Shell recipes" description="The tools you already have, piped into ThinkThen.">
  <h1>Shell recipes</h1>
  <p class="lede">The tools you already have, piped into ThinkThen.</p>

  <p>Each recipe is one <code>jq</code> line in front of ThinkThen and one behind it.</p>

  <p>Two shipped flags and one fixed row shape carry every recipe. <code>--jsonl</code> reads one JSON row per record. <code>--field</code> names the part the model sees. The row that comes back is <code>{'{"input": <the whole row>, "value": <the answer>}'}</code>. Paths, line numbers, dates, and ids ride through untouched and never reach the model.</p>

  <div class="note">No recipes yet. Each one appears here after its run is recorded.</div>

  <p class="pagelinks"><a href="/tutorial/">Take the tutorial</a> · <a href="/reference/">Read the reference</a> · <a href="/how-tos/">Try a how-to</a></p>
</Base>
